{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1782"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge history/modern-history","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/history__modern-history.g4.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",634],["+","Iran had already seen a coup of the other kind. Mohammad Mosaddegh, the democratically elected prime minister backed by parliament, nationalised the British-owned Anglo-Iranian Oil Company in 1951. On 19 August 1953 a coup organised by the CIA (Operation Ajax) and Britain's MI6 (Operation Boot) toppled him; General Fazlollah Zahedi became prime minister, and the Shah returned to rule with growing autocracy.\n\nA quarter of a century later "],["=",6],["-","a"],["+","that"],["=",133],["+","19 August 1953 | Iran | Mohammad Mosaddegh | Fazlollah Zahedi (for the Shah) |\n| "],["=",133]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",602],["-","Ajatollah"],["+","Der"],["=",1],["-","Chomeini"],["+","Iran"],["=",1],["+","hatte bereits einen Putsch der anderen Art erlebt. Mohammad Mossadegh, der demokratisch gewählte, vom Parlament getragene Ministerpräsident, verstaatlichte 1951 die britische Anglo-Iranian Oil Company. Am 19. August 1953 "],["=",2],["-","eine"],["+","ihn"],["=",1],["+","ein von der CIA (Operation Ajax) und dem britischen MI6 (Operation Boot) organisierter Putsch; General Fazlollah Zahedi wurde Ministerpräsident, und der Schah regierte fortan zunehmend autokratisch.\n\nEin Vierteljahrhundert später stürzte Ajatollah Chomeini diese "],["=",134],["+","19. August 1953 | Iran | Mohammad Mossadegh | Fazlollah Zahedi (für den Schah) |\n| "],["=",133]]}]},
